msgstr "mRobotics KitCAN CAN/DroneCAN 适配器节点+罗盘+气压计"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mro-kitcan.rst:7 5a8adaf9ec864767951fd9b88b257371
#: 5dc80d84cb3044118bab23086c73470b a76e9532c1b24db9b7c1a0da863c3408
#: ac553398369a42cfa8c1d913e0eeb4ea bb8eeeaa4caa40a7ad7e2bb8dc7959b6
msgid ""
"The next generation of integration from the mRo :ref:`CAN/DroneCAN Adapter "
"Node <common-mro-uavcan-adapter-node>`, the KitCAN integrates an ultra high "
"precision magnetometer and barometer, in addition to providing an easy means"
" of interfacing conventional GPS and Airspeed Sensors to DroneCAN, using a "
"single CAN bus connection to the autopilot. It also includes an RGB LED and "
"Arm Switch/Button."
msgstr ""
"这是 mRo :ref:`CAN/DroneCAN 适配器节点 <common-mro-uavcan-adapter-node>` "
"的下一代集成产品。KitCAN 除了提供将传统 GPS 和空速传感器接入 DroneCAN 的便捷途径外，还集成了超高精度磁力计和气压计，通过单条 "
"CAN 总线与飞控连接。此外还包含 RGB LED 和解锁开关/按钮。"

